{
    "_notes":  "Import rules for Assets/VFX/Gateway/* (read by GatewayImport.cs). First rule whose \u0027match\u0027 is contained in the asset path wins. compression = TextureImporterCompression name. wrapU/wrapV = Repeat|Clamp (equirect: U repeats around the sphere, V clamps at the poles). Real Hades-env panoramas: 8k equirect PNG/EXR, set sRGB false for .exr (linear HDR).",
    "rules":  [
                  {
